## Sources

1. T. Young, "On the theory of light and colours", *Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society* 92, 12–48
   (1802), and "Experiments and calculations relative to physical optics", same journal, 94, 1–16 (1804).
2. A. Fresnel, "Mémoire sur la diffraction de la lumière", *Mémoires de l'Académie des Sciences* 5, 339–475 (1826).
3. Lord Rayleigh, "Investigations in optics, with special reference to the spectroscope", *Philosophical Magazine* 8,
   261–274 (1879).
4. E. Hecht, *Optics*, 5th ed., Pearson (2017), chapters 9 and 10.
